# Local `act` testing scratch — created ad hoc while iterating on an action,
# never committed. .github/test-fixtures/ is the one committed exception.
.test-fixture/

# Fixture-generated deps, not part of the fixture itself.
.github/test-fixtures/**/node_modules/

# Compiled binaries left behind by local `go build`/`go test` runs against a Go fixture.
.github/test-fixtures/**/*-test-fixture*
.github/test-fixtures/**/*-broken

# Local agent/editor settings. Nothing here is shared.
.claude/
